{
 "version": 1,
 "spec": "planning/08-feature-specs.md #12, planning/03-backend.md §6, phase 16 T1",
 "rules": [
  "Dates are YYYY-MM-DD calendar dates (no time, no zone); the server passes the Asia/Kolkata date as today.",
  "Occurrence 0 is the anchor (the original expense); copies are occurrences 1, 2, ...",
  "Each occurrence is computed from the anchor: weekly +7n days, fortnightly +14n days, monthly +n months and yearly +n years with day = min(anchor day, last day of that month).",
  "ends_on is inclusive and may equal the anchor; ends_on < anchor is ENDS_BEFORE_ANCHOR.",
  "op next: first copy strictly after input.after and not after ends_on, else null.",
  "op series: occurrences 0..count-1 (ignores ends_on).",
  "op run: one generator run; dates = copies with next_date <= date <= today (and <= ends_on), oldest first; next = first copy >= next_date and > today, or null when none is left."
 ],
